113	/**
114	 * Normalises the optional owner {@code email}. Email is optional, so a null/blank value is left
115	 * untouched and stored as absent. When present it must be a syntactically valid address; the
116	 * cleaned, lower-cased value is written back onto the (shared) request DTO so it is stored and
117	 * returned as {@code email}. Anything present but syntactically invalid is rejected 400 via
118	 * {@link InvalidEmailException}.
